{"page":222,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:6","surah":11,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَمَا مِن دَآبَّةٍ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ إِلَّا عَلَى ٱللَّهِ رِزْقُهَا وَيَعْلَمُ مُسْتَقَرَّهَا وَمُسْتَوْدَعَهَا ۚ كُلٌّ فِى كِتَـٰبٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is not a creature that moves on earth whose provision is not His concern. He knows where it lives and its [final] resting place: it is all [there] in a clear record.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"moving creature","transliteration":"dābbatin","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رِزْقُهَا","en_gloss":"(is) its provision","transliteration":"riz'quhā","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"And He knows","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُسْتَقَرَّهَا","en_gloss":"its dwelling place","transliteration":"mus'taqarrahā","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمُسْتَوْدَعَهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"and its place of storage","transliteration":"wamus'tawdaʿahā","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كُلٌّۭ","en_gloss":"All","transliteration":"kullun","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","en_gloss":"a Record","transliteration":"kitābin","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُّبِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnin","verse_key":"11:6"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:6"}]},{"verse_key":"11:7","surah":11,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٍ وَكَانَ عَرْشُهُۥ عَلَى ٱلْمَآءِ لِيَبْلُوَكُمْ أَيُّكُمْ أَحْسَنُ عَمَلًا ۗ وَلَئِن قُلْتَ إِنَّكُم مَّبْعُوثُونَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ٱلْمَوْتِ لَيَقُولَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحْرٌ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who created the heavens and the earth in six Days––His rule extends over the waters too––so as to test which of you does best. Yet [Prophet], if you say to them, ‘You will be resurrected after death,’ the disbelievers are sure to answer, ‘This is clearly nothing but sorcery.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سِتَّةِ","en_gloss":"six","transliteration":"sittati","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","en_gloss":"epochs","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"and His throne was","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَرْشُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His throne was","transliteration":"ʿarshuhu","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the water","transliteration":"l-māi","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِيَبْلُوَكُمْ","en_gloss":"that He might test [you]","transliteration":"liyabluwakum","verse_key":"11:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَيُّكُمْ","e